#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**Beschreibung:**"

#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:13
msgid ""
"Trims all leading and trailing whitespaces from ``text``. The optional "
"second parameter ``characters`` specifies the characters to trim instead of "
"whitespace. Each of the characters provided in ``characters`` is removed "
"from both ends of ``text``, whatever their order."
msgstr ""

